-## 📈 Performance
+## Store rebuild
 
-- **Retrieval**: ~200ms (hybrid search)
-- **LLM Response**: ~2-5s (depending on model)
-- **Total Latency**: ~3-7s per query
+`build_store.py` reads `data/docs_cache.pkl` when present. Pickle is executable serialization. Use the cache only when its repository origin and checksum have been verified.
 
----
+Do not overwrite the current store during QA. Build into a new directory, audit it, compare retrieval results, and promote it after review.
 
-## 📄 License
+The builder now stops when an existing store has no checkpoint and its document count differs from the cache. This prevents silent duplicate appends.
 
